    "title": "A small update to my website",
    "publishedAt": "2026-10-17",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-17",
    "author": "MvL",
    "summary": "I added a knowledge wiki, categories, and search to my website.",
    "category": "Website",
    "image": "/images/blog/blog-knowledge-search.jpg",
    "content": "I have been working on a few updates to thehomelabber.io.\n\nThe website now has a [Knowledge wiki](/knowledge). This is a place where I can collect practical notes, instructions, and solutions from my homelab. It will grow over time as I learn new things and document my setups.\n\nI also added categories and a search bar to both the [blog](/blog) and the wiki. This makes it easier to find articles about a specific topic, such as Proxmox, Linux, or networking.\n\nBuilding these features was also a learning experience. Step by step, I learned more about how the website reads MDX files, shows articles, and filters content.\n\nThere is still more I want to improve, but I am happy with this update. My website is slowly becoming a place where I can share my experiences and keep useful information together.\n\n![Blog and knowledge wiki with search and categories](/images/blog/blog-knowledge-search.jpg)",
